      "text": "Medical Report 2 — Patient Summary \n\nPatient Name: Aisha Rahman Age: 28 Gender: Female \n\nChief Complaint: \n\nComplains of irregular menstrual cycles and recent weight gain. \n\nClinical Observations: \n\n- Vitals: BP 118/76 mmHg, Pulse 82 bpm \n\n- Mild acne on face, no hirsutism \n\n- BMI: 29.1 \n\nPreliminary Diagnosis: Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS) \n\nRecommendations: \n\n1. Pelvic ultrasound to confirm ovarian cysts \n\n2. Prescribe Metformin and recommend low-carb diet \n\n3. Follow-up in 6 weeks to monitor response \n\nPhysician: Dr. Neha Kapoor Date: 2025-04-08",
